 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5433+) **Earth2 start distribution rework:** for Huge and beyond world sizes, keep Earth2 at its existing **Huge-scale sizing** (already large enough), but solve crowding by **populating underused landmasses instead** (e.g., min 16 players before Africa is populated, min 32 players before the whole world is populated) of enlarging the script further. **Thresholds are based on player count** (not world size). See [`GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml`](/Assets/XML/GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5444+) Add **Deer percentage map option** (e.g., `0/10/25/50/75/100`) for [Arboria.py](/PrivateMaps/Arboria.py) and [Boreal.py](/PrivateMaps/Boreal.py): **high-food terrain** (e.g. grass) maps like Arboria, or **lower-food terrain** ones (e.g. tundra/plains) like Boreal, had **too much deer**. See also See [KI#105](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#105---fixed-base-advciv-bug-of-most-bonuses-eg-deer-sometimes-not-appearing-at-first-civ4-launch-in-some-maps-eg-boreal).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5446+) **Order maps alphabetically** in **Simple Game** or **Custom Game** (by adding missing map scripts in **PrivateMaps**).
-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5439+) **Remove from Simple Game** some maps that are deemed not essential or unbalanced; they are remain playable via the **Custom Game** menu: [Big_and_Small.py](/PrivateMaps/Big_and_Small.py), [Great_Plains.py](/PrivateMaps/Great_Plains.py), [Earth2.py](/PrivateMaps/Earth2.py), [Hemispheres.py](/PrivateMaps/Hemispheres.py), [Lakes.py](/PrivateMaps/Lakes.py) (has too few lakes), [Oasis.py](/PrivateMaps/Oasis.py), [Shuffle.py](/PrivateMaps/Shuffle.py), [Tectonics.py](/PrivateMaps/Tectonics.py).
+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5439+) **Remove from Simple Game** some maps that are deemed not essential or unbalanced; they are remain playable via the **Custom Game** menu: [Big_and_Small.py](/PrivateMaps/Big_and_Small.py), [Great_Plains.py](/PrivateMaps/Great_Plains.py), [Earth2.py](/PrivateMaps/Earth2.py), [Hemispheres.py](/PrivateMaps/Hemispheres.py), [Lakes.py](/PrivateMaps/Lakes.py) (has too few lakes), [Mixed_Continents.py](/PrivateMaps/Mixed_Continents.py), [Oasis.py](/PrivateMaps/Oasis.py), [Shuffle.py](/PrivateMaps/Shuffle.py), [Tectonics.py](/PrivateMaps/Tectonics.py).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5439+) **Add** or **redo** the .dds (i.e. image) in **Simple Game** for maps so it is more illustrative or accurate than a dark or incorrect globe map. See [Readme.md (New .dds for maps in Simple Game)](/README.md#new-dds-for-maps-in-simple-game) and [CIV4WorldPickerInfos.xml](/Assets/XML/Interface/CIV4WorldPickerInfos.xml).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5455+) **Add** a new AdvCiv-SAS original map: [SAS_Longworld](/PrivateMaps/SAS_Longworld.py): A lightweight long-format world for AdvCiv-SAS: one connected horizontal landmass with wavy borders, inspired by Ringworld3_102_mst.py but heavily simplified. Similarly also **add** [SAS_Spiky_Avenues.py](/PrivateMaps/SAS_Spiky_Avenues.py) (Compact tactical map with repeated streets: each street has facing houses (spikes), a central avenue, and bridges on left/right edges to connect streets). See [Readme.md (AdvCiv-SAS original mapscripts)](/README.md#advciv-sas-original-mapscripts-eg-sas_longworld-sas_spiky_avenues).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5437+) **Add** and **adapt** [BTG_Cross.py](/PrivateMaps/BTG_Cross.py) map (from the Beyond the Game mod (v2.43)): remove non-AdvCiv BTG options/logic, **fix script compatibility issues**, support **max player count** and up to **world size SAS48**, **change some options** (e.g., allow Desert as Default), and expose the map in both **Simple Game** and **Custom Game** lists. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5438+) Similarly add **other BTG maps**: [BTG_Grid.py](/PrivateMaps/BTG_Grid.py), [BTG_Lagoon.py](/PrivateMaps/BTG_Lagoon.py).

